  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Wrap the beets in foil and bake for 45 minutes or until tender.",
    "Mix the salt and water to create a salt bath.",
    "Once the beets are done, let them cool, then peel and slice them.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the olive oil, garlic, lemon juice, and black pepper.",
    "To assemble the bowls, place a sliced beet in the bottom of an earthenware bowl.",
    "Drizzle the olive oil mixture over the beets.",
    "Top with chopped cilantro leaves and a sprinkle of salt."
  ],
